  "derivation": {
    "kind": "focused projection of the pinned OpenAPI JSON",
    "documentationPageUsedAsContractSource": false,
    "notes": [
      "Every operationId, HTTP method, path, success status and member name in docs/contract.json was read out of the JSON document at the specUrl above, not out of a rendered documentation page.",
      "The 9.1.0.0 revision of the same file (commit 3949fc33339fc5ea1b77eadb258f1cf49aa88e26) is deliberately NOT the source. It diverges from 9.0.0.0 in exactly the schemas this contract projects: 9.1 relaxes Network.required from [gateway, mask, mtu, subnet, type, vlanId] to [mtu, type, vlanId], adds the Network members freeIpCount, usedIpCount, ipAddressAssignmentMode and ipAddressVersion, and drops the IPv4 dotted-quad pattern from IpPool.start and IpPool.end.",
      "The 9.0.0.0 document declares no components.securitySchemes and no global security requirement, so the Authorization: Bearer header this contract requires is a deployment convention of SDDC Manager pinned by docs/contract.json and the shipped mock. It is not presented as a claim derived from the specification."
    ]
  }
